# Kompis Live AI — Provider Secret Rule

## Rule

Kompis live AI may use `AIPIFY_KOMPIS_AI_API_KEY` (authoritative) or `OPENAI_API_KEY` (fallback) server-side only.

## Forbidden

- Reading, logging, copying, or reporting secret values, prefixes, lengths, or hashes
- Asking the user to paste an API key into chat
- Writing secret values into code, migrations, commits, PR bodies, or reports
- Creating provider accounts, purchasing credit, or changing billing
- Faking live AI as active when the secret is absent

## Required

- Presence checks may only return booleans
- Deterministic planner fallback must remain active when live AI is not ready
- Report env **names** only when configuration is required
